        "status": "present",
        "value": "Treat each seat pair as a node and connect two nodes when they share a couple. Each node has degree two, so components are cycles. A cycle of c pairs needs c-1 swaps, because each swap can raise the number of completed pairs by at most one except the last swap, which completes two."
      },
